    narr:narration """This position holds the settled cadence for recurring reaction summaries: [the per-run bundle stays and a weekly roll-up is added on Fridays](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), restated verbatim two days later as [team policy](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_2). The scope line runs through [Tanya's clarification that the bundle is for the run and the roll-up is for the week](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), echoed in the later record ([same ruling](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_4)). A rejected alternative is on the graph: [the daily digest was turned down because it would repeat the bundle word for word](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5), with the rejection rationale recorded again in the later pass ([rejection re-recorded](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_5)). Tina's scope question was relayed both times ([asked whether the roll-up replaces the bundle](narr:Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3); [the same question relayed again](narr:Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_3)). A third dated pass restates the whole record unchanged — [the ruling quoted a third time](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_2), [the scope line repeated](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_4), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_5), and [the scope question relayed once more](narr:Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_3). A fourth dated pass now repeats the record a final time — [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_2), [the clarification restated](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_4), [the rejection carried forward](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_5), and [the scope question relayed yet again](narr:Expr_20261001_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_ha7f40d1c5663_3). A fifth dated pass repeats the record once more — [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_3), [the scope line carried forward](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_5), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_6), and [the scope question relayed again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_4). The phrasing carries the hub's style-lane signature — antithesis and parallelism in the org lane.""" ;
    narr:reaction """One thing moved: a fifth dated pass arrived, so the record now runs [the ruling quoted again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_3), [the scope line carried forward](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_5), [the rejection recorded again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_6), and [the scope question relayed again](narr:Expr_20261003_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h1f5318ecf934_4). Nothing in the substance shifted — the ruling, the scope line, the rejection, and the relayed question are unchanged — so every prior sentence held byte for byte and one sentence was added to carry the new pass. The pattern the old narration already described (verbatim repetition across dated passes) simply extends one pass further.""" ;
